Zendure zenSDK for Home Assistant
=================================

Based on an idea by Gielz1986 (Michiel Hofker):
https://github.com/Gielz1986/Zendure-HA-zenSDK

This repository is a derivative work of "Zendure Home Assistant -
Zendure-HA-zenSDK (Gielz)" (global / English version). The original license is
included unchanged in the file LICENSE and applies to this repository as well.

Modifications made to the original
----------------------------------
- The YAML package, automation and helpers were reimplemented as a Home
  Assistant custom integration written in Python (config flow, one polling
  coordinator, native entities).
- The control logic of the automation was ported to Python for the modes
  Standby, Manual, Smart Matching, Smart Charge Only, Smart Discharge Only,
  Quick Charge and Quick Discharge.
- Energy counters, efficiencies, round-trip efficiency, relay switch counters
  and calibration tracking are computed inside the integration.
- The Dynamic (price based) modes and the Node-RED proxy add-ons were not
  ported.
- The dashboard was rewritten for the new entity IDs.

